Rockchip prebuilt kbuild (statically linked) and scripts
=========================================================

Host-side kbuild tools (`scripts/` and `tools/objtool/`) used when building
the Linux kernel on the target device.

Layout:
  aarch64/  kbuild tools for aarch64 targets
  armhf/    kbuild tools for armhf targets
  mk-kbuild.sh
            Script to rebuild the tools from a kernel source tree

To rebuild, the kernel source must contain the Debian packaging files. Debian
package files come from a specific tag in:
https://salsa.debian.org/kernel-team/linux

Prebuilt from a Debian bookworm armhf/aarch64 rootfs.
